://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109503.patch","merged_at":"2026-06-22T13:34:29Z"},"body":"This makes the `AudioStreamPlayer3D` `volume_db` have an upper limit of 24dB instead of 80dB, bringing it in line with the other stream players.\r\n\r\nThis also adds `or_greater` to all the stream players' `volume_db` sliders.\r\n\r\nClosed https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109454 in favor of this.\r\n\r\nAs mentioned in the above PR, I believe this should be merged alongside (or before) https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109452, so people don't quickly drag up the `AudioStreamPlayer3D` dB volume sliders and explode their ears.\r\n\r\n`or_greater` was originally added to keep compat, in case anyone had their 3D stream player `volume_db` sliders above 24. [It was suggested](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109454#issuecomment-3170652411) that `or_greater` be added to the other stream players, so I created this PR\r\n\r\nEDIT: dang, I realized I named the branch very poorly. I hope that isn't a problem","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api